den chains and red armor, and bears large crystals on its back which it can use as offensive weapons. Its Amulet is in the possession of Gregor.\n\nHistory\n\nBarrage was invoked by Gregor at Skara Brae to fight Dante Vale's Caliban. He and Executioner worked together to defeat Caliban but were defeated themselves by Grand Dragon Leviathan.[Mission to Skara Brae]\n\nAbilities\n\nBarrage's primary offensive ability lies in its large crystals that can fire blasts of energy.\n\nGallery","raw_wikitext":"{{stub}}\n{{Infobox titan\n|image = File:Barrage.png\n|attack = 5\n|defense = 4\n|type = [[Yama-Titan]] Warrior\n|size = Medium\n|special ability = Crystal Missiles\n|first = \"[[Mission to Skara Brae]]\"\n|user(s) = [[Gregor]]}}\n'''Barrage''' is a veridian-colored [[Yama-Titan]] with a red, horned face. It dons golden chains and red armor, and bears large crystals on its back which it can use as offensive weapons. Its [[Amulet]] is in the possession of [[Gregor]].\n\n== History ==\nBarrage was invoked by Gregor at [[Skara Brae]] to fight [[Dante Vale]]'s [[Caliban]].  He and [[Executioner]] worked together to defeat Caliban but were defeated themselves by [[Grand Dragon Leviathan]].{{source|Mission to Skara Brae}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nBarrage's primary offensive ability lies in its large crystals that can fire blasts of energy.\n\n== Gallery ==\n[[Category:Yama-Titans]]\n[[Category:Article stubs]]\n[[Category:Warrior Titans]]\n[[Category:Organization Titans]]\n[[Category:Medium Titans]]\n[[Category:Titans]]\n{{Clear}}{{YamaBox}}","categories":["Article stubs","Medium Titans","Organization Titans","Titans","Warrior Titans","Yama-Titans"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:2837","status":"resolved","target_title":"Yama-Titan","label":"Yama-Titan","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Yama-Titan","href":"#/categories?name=Yama-Titans"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:10451","status":"resolved","target_title":"Mission to Skara Brae","label":"Mission to Skara Brae","target_